---

<Layout title="Session 120 — Tales of the Radiant Citadel" description="The party wrapped up its business at home before leaving for Yeonido. Toven raised QDV in the Cauldron of Rebirth, and he was installed as Lord of the Cran">
  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-20">
    <a href="/studio" class="text-sm text-earth hover:text-ink transition-colors mb-6 inline-block">&larr; Studio</a>

    <h1 class="font-heading text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black leading-tight mb-2">
      Session 120
    </h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-earth mb-1">Tales of the Radiant Citadel &middot; November 10, 2026</p>
    <p class="text-sm text-ink-light mb-8">Return to the Radiant Citadel → the Kenazaro quest</p>

    <div class="prose-section text-ink-light leading-relaxed mb-12 space-y-4">
      <p>
        The party wrapped up its business at home before leaving for Yeonido. Toven raised <strong>QDV</strong> in the Cauldron of Rebirth, and he was installed as <strong>Lord of the Cranium Rats</strong>, with a first decree of kindness and space lasers. Haru held an <strong>all-hands meeting</strong> for the uneasy Bastion staff. Gemnar threatened a hill giant into honoring the old ways, and Gordian answered Sigmar's &quot;designation&quot; question with Shocking Grasp and, for the first time, <strong>his own voice</strong>. Haru got dragon-parenting advice from a rattled Sholeh, then spent nearly all his gold to <strong>Hallow</strong> the hatchery, which worked thanks to a quiet Flash of Genius. In Yeonido, the <strong>Hall of Broken Names is closed</strong>, and Gordian's night walk turned up heavy guards, a strong magic aura, and the chance that Kyosal Inja has living descendants in the city.
      </p>
    </div>

    <h2 class="font-heading text-2xl font-bold mb-2">Highlights</h2>
    <ul class="text-sm text-ink-light leading-relaxed space-y-2 mb-12 list-disc list-inside">
      <li><strong class="text-ink">Previously, and a Ring With No Boundaries</strong> — Haru's recap of Gordian: <em>&quot;Somewhat inability to answer direct questions and amorphous and unclear history for how he ended up in Lemordia and what exactly drove him out of wherever he was. But ultimately, he dazzled us.&quot;</em></li>
      <li><strong class="text-ink">Who Lives Where</strong> — A Bastion audit: only Kiet and Haru remain from when the Bastion was founded. <em>&quot;Everybody changed after we made the Bastion.&quot;</em> Everyone gets 4 special facilities; the next tier opens at level 13. Sam posted the original roster in chat.</li>
      <li><strong class="text-ink">Twelve Has Concerns</strong> — While QDV cooked overnight in the cauldron (8 hours under 200 lb of salt; Raise Dead, not Reincarnate, so he comes back as himself), Twelve climbed onto Toven's shoulder in what Sam confirmed is his usual Scottish brogue. Table: <em>&quot;They're Highland rats.&quot;</em></li>
      <li><strong class="text-ink">QDV Rises</strong> — Late that night QDV bubbles out of the cauldron: <strong>&quot;Is my revenge complete? Are all of those who have wronged me dead?&quot;</strong> <em>&quot;Well, did we? Yeah, we got the big guy... let's just say yes.&quot;</em> QDV: <em>&quot;We need to get back there. We need to kill all of them. They were personally quite mean to me.&quot;</em></li>
      <li><strong class="text-ink">The All-Hands</strong> — Erasmo Sands, cooking breakfast for everyone: <em>&quot;Now that Dry Bones isn't around anymore, these breakfasts are a little bit easier... we don't have anyone else new with new dietary restrictions, do we?&quot;</em> <em>&quot;He eats... brains.&quot;</em> <em>&quot;Ah, a vegetarian? What, brains?&quot;</em> <strong>&quot;Grains. He eats grains. A whole grain bowl.&quot;</strong> <em>&quot;Lots of fiber.&quot;</em></li>
      <li><strong class="text-ink">The Old Ways</strong> — The giants have been sleeping in the yard and throwing trash everywhere. Gemnar wakes them to scold them for not honoring the old ways. Thick: <em>&quot;The old ways are for old people like you.&quot;</em> Gemnar's haymaker cracks his nose. <em>&quot;Not the best punch that you've ever laid out.&quot;</em> Thick punches a crack into the wall in reply.</li>
      <li><strong class="text-ink">No Designation</strong> — Bahram, the theater director, speaks for the public-facing staff: <em>&quot;There is no purpose for a theater director if there is no one to do plays for.&quot;</em> Haru: no one is forced to stay, and their jobs are secure <em>&quot;regardless of how the Citadel fares.&quot;</em> Rochano looks <em>&quot;a little out to sea.&quot;</em> Sigmar watches Gordian <em>&quot;with great interest but trying to look like he's not looking at him.&quot;</em></li>
      <li><strong class="text-ink">An Unsafe Work Environment</strong> — Calavera: <strong>&quot;Between when I said to you that lots of people are dying here and now, one of you threatened one or two of our lives, and now a second one of you almost shocked one of us to death. This seems like an unsafe work environment... my friend died here.&quot;</strong></li>
      <li><strong class="text-ink">Sholeh</strong> — Haru and Gordian visit the Preserve of Ancestors, whose crystal is full of gemstones that hold the spirits of the Citadel's dead. Sholeh and Ayazad the Djinn are at the central pavilion. <em>&quot;Ah, the present-day heroes of the Radiant Citadel.&quot;</em> Haru, on the new lineup: <em>&quot;Sammy Hagar instead of David Lee Roth.&quot;</em></li>
      <li><strong class="text-ink">Hallow</strong> — In the market, many shopkeepers are now <strong>illusions</strong>, and a few lines in, <em>&quot;the programmed responses don't quite match up with the questions.&quot;</em> Table: <em>&quot;He found a real person, or at least didn't notice that it was an AI — sorry, illusion.&quot;</em> The real shopkeepers shake your hand when you walk in.</li>
      <li><strong class="text-ink">Lord of the Cranium Rats</strong> — Toven leads QDV into the sewers through the warehouse route. <strong>Hundreds, perhaps thousands of rats</strong>, their exposed brains pulsing with psychic light, bow before him.</li>
      <li><strong class="text-ink">The City of Judgment</strong> — The embassy, by Concord Jewel. <em>&quot;You do not appear as refugees.&quot;</em> Haru counts <em>&quot;five of us, including the one who's standing very quietly with his middle finger out. He doesn't mean it the way it's commonly interpreted.&quot;</em></li>
      <li><strong class="text-ink">Gordian's Night Walk</strong> — Warforged don't sleep. Gordian casts <strong>Alter Self</strong> to look like <strong>Kiet, finger out</strong>, <em>&quot;let's be a little shady,&quot;</em> since the city is mostly dragonborn, and walks out with Blink while the party sleeps.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="font-heading text-2xl font-bold mb-6">Art</h2>
    <div class="space-y-10">
      {images.map((img) => (
        <figure>
          <img
            src={img.src}
            alt={img.title}
            class="w-full rounded-xl shadow-lg"
            loading="lazy"
          />
          <figcaption class="mt-3">
            <span class="font-semibold text-ink text-sm">{img.title}</span>
            <p class="text-sm text-ink-light mt-1">{img.caption}</p>
          </figcaption>
        </figure>
      ))}
    </div>

    <div class="border-t border-cream-dark mt-16 pt-8">
      <h2 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold mb-3">Party</h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 text-sm">
        <div><span class="font-semibold text-ink">Gordian (G-0)</span> <span class="text-ink-light">(Erik)</span></div>
        <div><span class="font-semibold text-ink">Kiet</span> <span class="text-ink-light">(Jonas)</span></div>
        <div><span class="font-semibold text-ink">Virgil Gemnar</span> <span class="text-ink-light">(Kyle)</span></div>
        <div><span class="font-semibold text-ink">Toven</span> <span class="text-ink-light">(Max)</span></div>
        <div><span class="font-semibold text-ink">Haru</span> <span class="text-ink-light">(Hunter)</span></div>
        <div><span class="font-semibold text-ink">DM</span> <span class="text-ink-light">(Sam)</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
